<section class="ethical">
  <div class="container">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Our Standards</p>
      <h2>Ethical &amp; Confidential Process</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Your privacy and trust are protected at every stage. We operate under strict ethical guidelines to ensure a fair, respectful, and completely confidential experience.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 main pillars -->
    <div class="ethical-pillars">

      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
            <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Strict Confidentiality</h3>
        <p>Everything discussed during mediation remains completely private. We never share your information with third parties, courts, or anyone outside the session without your explicit consent.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Complete Neutrality</h3>
        <p>Our mediator takes no sides. We facilitate balanced conversations where every party is heard equally — ensuring a fair environment that encourages genuine resolution.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Protected by Law</h3>
        <p>Mediation communications are legally protected under Texas law and applicable federal regulations, giving you the confidence to speak openly and work toward resolution.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Process steps -->
    <div class="process-wrap">
      <h3 class="process-title">How We Protect You — Step by Step</h3>
      <div class="process-steps">

        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-number">01</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h4>Signed Confidentiality Agreement</h4>
            <p>Before any session begins, all parties sign a binding confidentiality agreement ensuring nothing shared can be used against you.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-number">02</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h4>Secure Virtual Sessions</h4>
            <p>All mediation is conducted via encrypted Zoom sessions — no in-person travel required, and your session is never recorded without consent.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-number">03</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h4>Neutral Facilitation</h4>
            <p>Our certified mediator guides discussion without influencing outcomes — you and the other party retain full decision-making power.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-number">04</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h4>Voluntary &amp; Self-Determined</h4>
            <p>Participation is voluntary. Any agreement reached is created by the parties themselves, not imposed — making outcomes more durable and respected.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom note -->
    <div class="ethical-note">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/>
        <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/>
      </svg>
      <p>Valor Mediation, LLC adheres to the ethical standards set by the <strong>Texas Mediator Credentialing Association (TMCA)</strong> and follows all applicable state and federal confidentiality laws.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>



<section class="msa">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="msa-inner">

      <!-- Left: Content -->
      <div class="msa-content">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">Legal Protection</p>
        <h2>Legally Binding &amp; Enforceable Agreements (MSA)</h2>
        <p class="msa-lead">A Mediation Settlement Agreement (MSA) is not just a discussion — it's a legally binding contract that protects everyone involved.</p>

        <ul class="msa-list">
          <li>
            <span class="msa-check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>Agreements are enforceable in court once signed by all parties</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="msa-check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>Clearly defined terms protect all parties involved</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="msa-check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>Courts uphold valid MSAs that meet legal standards</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="msa-check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>Can be approved by courts for additional enforcement — especially in family matters</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="msa-check">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span>Provides faster resolution than traditional litigation</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="msa-closing">Mediation gives you control — while still offering the full protection of a legally recognized agreement.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Info box -->
      <div class="msa-box">
        <div class="msa-box-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
            <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>What is an MSA?</h3>
        <p>A <strong>Mediation Settlement Agreement</strong> is a written document that records the terms both parties have agreed upon during mediation.</p>
        <div class="msa-divider"></div>
        <div class="msa-stat">
          <span class="stat-value">Legally Binding</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Once signed by all parties</span>
        </div>
        <div class="msa-stat">
          <span class="stat-value">Court Enforceable</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Upheld under Texas &amp; federal law</span>
        </div>
        <div class="msa-stat">
          <span class="stat-value">Your Terms</span>
          <span class="stat-label">You control the outcome — not a judge</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

